Hey [~accountid:641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d] , [~accountid:63da287e790148a18093a774] !

Yes flows works almost like that. In more detail:
1. Couriers provide data to the fleets or already have provided them before (if there are existing employees);
2. Fleet registers couriers via provided form, entering courier details and also uploading documents (so we can verify the person);
3. Once the fleet has registered couriers via the form, OPS verifies the lead details, creates an account and assigns a courier account to this exact fleet;
4. After that, couriers can log in to the Bolt Courier app and start delivering. All earnings go to the fleet account, which later pays to the couriers.

Hope this answers your question! If there is anything else, I will be happy to help!

Best regards,
Roberts

